envd vendored protocol buffer schemas
======================================

This directory contains protocol buffer schemas vendored verbatim from
the upstream E2B project (https://github.com/e2b-dev/infra), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Copyright 2023-present FoundryLabs, Inc. and the E2B contributors.

The upstream commit and per-file mapping is recorded in SOURCE in this
directory. The vendored files MUST remain byte-identical to upstream so
that the published E2B SDKs (Python, JS, etc.) interoperate with envd
without surprise field-tag or schema drift.

