Per Apache-2.0 section 4(b), this NOTICE file is included alongside any
redistribution of the vendored schemas. Modifications applied on top of
the pinned upstream commit are called out in SOURCE; today the only
deviation is two additive RPCs on the filesystem service (WriteAll /
ReadAll) backing sandbawks's HMAC-signed file upload/download flow.
The existing upstream RPCs and field tags are unchanged, so the
published E2B SDKs remain wire-compatible with the metadata surface.
